ication-ecla><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="EN">WIRE SAW AND CUTTING METHOD</invention-title><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="FR">FIL HELICOIDAL ET PROCEDE DE DECOUPE</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-10138231-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>10138231</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-11058365-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11058365</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="XP" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-11216656-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11216656</doc-number><kind>A</kind> </document-id><sources><source category="XP" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-11221748-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11221748</doc-number> <kind>A</kind> </document-id> <sources><source category="AP" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-7001442-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>7001442</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1097782A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ARIGA YASUHARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHINETSU HANDOTAI KK</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARIGA, YASUHARU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN-ETSU HANDOTAI CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ARIGA YASUHARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARIGA, YASUHARU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A wire saw is provided in which a wire (4) running on a plurality of grooved rollers (2A, 2B, 2C, 2D) is pressed against a workpiece (8) to cut it. In cutting a workpiece while controlling its temperature, the grooved rollers are supplied with cutting liquid containing abrasive particles, and the workpiece is supplied with temperature control means (12A, 12B, 13A, 13B). Since the influences of heat during a cutting process are controlled, the relative deviation between the workpiece and the wire is reduced, a wafer is prevented from warping, and wafer flatness is maintained in a polishing process.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un fil hélicoïdal dans lequel un fil (4) passant sur plusieurs rouleaux à rainure (2A, 2B, 2C, 2D) est comprimé contre une pièce à travailler (8) aux fins de découpe. Dans la découpe de cette pièce sous contrôle de la température, les rouleaux à rainure reçoivent un liquide de découpe qui contient des particules abrasives, et la pièce à travailler est elle-même contrôlée par un système de contrôle de température (12A, 12B, 13A, 13B). Etant donné que l'incidence de la chaleur durant le processus de découpe est contrôlée, l'écart relatif entre la pièce à travailler et le fil est réduit, moyennant quoi on évite tout gauchissement sur une plaquette et on assure le maintien de la planéité d'une plaquette dans un processus de polissage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>